<%# In tests, animations end at once: a SweetAlert dialog still scaling in moves its buttons between
    Capybara finding "Yes" and clicking it, so the click misses and the dialog stays open. Every
    layout that loads SweetAlert (admin, application, login) renders this. %>
<% if Rails.env.test? %>
  <style>*, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }</style>
<% end %>
